OL,3,GNEWSABangladeshi art spotlighted in
OL,4,A'world-first' project
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new partnership is set to spotlight
OL,7,FBangladeshi art at the world's oldest
OL,8,Ffree-to-enter public museum.
OL,10,FThe Ashmolean Museum, in Oxford, said
OL,11,Fit would be teaming up with the Samdani
OL,12,FArt Foundation to highlight work from
OL,13,Fthe nation.
OL,15,FThe University of Oxford institution
OL,16,Fsaid the project was the first
OL,17,F"sustained initiative" supporting
OL,18,FBangladeshi artists at any major museum
OL,19,Facross the globe.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
