OL,3,GNEWSABangladeshi art spotlighted in
OL,4,A'world-first' project
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs part of the new scheme, a visiting
OL,7,Fartist will be invited to Oxford each
OL,8,Fyear and a dedicated collection of
OL,9,FBangladeshi art will also be curated.
